{% comment %}
  The role a profile gets when nothing passes one explicitly.

  Our own signup always passes a role, because a visitor chooses guest or host.
  This is the floor for every other path that creates a user without asking:
  oauth, invites, a console-created account. Guest is the safe floor, since it
  grants no listing or admin permission.
{% endcomment %}
{% liquid
  function result = 'modules/core/commands/variable/set', name: 'USER_DEFAULT_ROLE', value: 'guest'
  log result, type: 'setup_user_default_role result'
%}
